{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14719","headline":"宿慧山寺 一 · 朱宿","name":"宿慧山寺 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古寺隐秋山，登攀度林樾。\n悠然清莲界，此地尘境绝。\n机闲任昼昏，虑澹知生灭。\n微吹递遥泉，疎松对残月。\n庭虚露华缀，池净荷香发。\n心悟形未留，迟迟履归辙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱宿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}